docs {
  # Inventory Finished Goods (FG) List
  
  Service Pengambil: `App\Services\InventoryFgService`
  Command Scheduler: `php artisan sync:delivery-data`
  
  Sub-Endpoints yang digabungkan:
  - `/api/sap_inventory_fg/list`
  - `/api/sap_inventory_fg_semi/list`
  - `/api/sap_inventory_fg_semi_wip/list`
  - `/api/sap_inventory_fg_semi_semi_wip/list`
  
  Tabel Tujuan: `sap_inventory_fg`
  Kolom Utama: `item_code`, `item_name`, `item_group`, `day_set_pps`, `setup_time`, `cycle_time`, `cavity`, `safety_stock`, `daily_limit`, `stock`, `total_spk`, `standar_packing`, `man_power`, `warehouse`, `process_owner`, `family`.
}
